#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:380
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WelcomeForSingleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the hearts of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test.\p"
"I welcome you to the BATTLE PALACE.\p"
"I accept challenges to the SINGLE\n"
"BATTLE HALLS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家之心的地方。\p"
"欢迎来到对战宫殿。\p"
"这里受理单打对战大厅的挑战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_TakeSingleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to take\n"
"the SINGLE BATTLE HALL challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战单打对战大厅吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:391
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainSingleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE PALACE, there are\n"
"several auditoriums for SINGLE BATTLES\l"
"that are named SINGLE BATTLE HALLS.\p"
"The SINGLE BATTLES are conducted in\n"
"the usual way, except with one crucial\l"
"rule that must be obeyed.\p"
"TRAINERS are permitted only to switch\n"
"their POKéMON in and out.\p"
"TRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\n"
"command their POKéMON.\p"
"The POKéMON are to behave according\n"
"to their nature and battle on their own.\p"
"You must put your trust in your\n"
"POKéMON and watch over them.\p"
"If you achieve the honor of beating\n"
"seven TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, you must save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战宫殿里有好几个\n"
"进行单打对战的会场，\l"
"名为单打对战大厅。\p"
"单打对战会按照平常的方式进行，\n"
"但有一条必须遵守的重要规则。\p"
"训练家只能\n"
"交换宝可梦。\p"
"除此之外，训练家\n"
"不得向宝可梦下达指令。\p"
"宝可梦会按照自己的性格\n"
"自行战斗。\p"
"你必须信任你的宝可梦，\n"
"在一旁守护它们。\p"
"如果能光荣地连续打败\n"
"7位训练家，\l"
"我们会送你对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"必须记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:414
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ReturnWhenFortified"
msgid ""
"When you have fortified your heart\n"
"and POKéMON, you must return.$"
msgstr ""
"等你和宝可梦的心都\n"
"变得更坚强之后，再回来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:418
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WhichChallenge"
msgid ""
"There are two BATTLE HALLS,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice of a challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"对战大厅有两种：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要挑战哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:423
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for the challenge.\p"
"To enter, you must provide three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"These POKéMON must all be of\n"
"Level 50 or lower.\p"
"They also must not be holding\n"
"the same kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"你没有挑战所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参加挑战，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"这些宝可梦的等级\n"
"都必须在50以下。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:435
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"Come back when you have made\n"
"your preparations.$"
msgstr "准备好之后再来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for the challenge.\p"
"To enter, you must provide three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not be holding\n"
"the same kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"你没有挑战所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参加挑战，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:449
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NowSelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Good. Now, you must select your\n"
"three POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"好。现在，请选择\n"
"你的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:453
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_MustSaveBeforeChallenge2"
msgid ""
"I must save before I show you to\n"
"the BATTLE HALL. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战大厅之前，\n"
"我必须先记录。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:457
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_FollowMe"
msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"Now, follow me.$"
msgstr ""
"好。\n"
"现在，请跟我来。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ResultsWillBeRecorded"
msgid ""
"I feel privileged for having seen\n"
"your POKéMON's exploits.\p"
"The results will be recorded.\n"
"I must ask you to briefly wait.$"
msgstr ""
"能见证你的宝可梦的表现，\n"
"我深感荣幸。\p"
"成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候片刻。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:467
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_FirmTrueBondsFor7WinStreak"
msgid ""
"To achieve a 7-win streak…\p"
"The bonds that bind your heart with\n"
"your POKéMON seem firm and true.$"
msgstr ""
"取得了7连胜……\p"
"你和宝可梦之间的羁绊\n"
"看来坚定而真挚。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:472
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_FeatWillBeRecorded"
msgid ""
"Your feat will be recorded.\n"
"I must ask you to briefly wait.$"
msgstr ""
"你的成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候片刻。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:477
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_BattlePointsFor7WinStreak"
msgid ""
"For the feat of your 7-win streak,\n"
"we present you with Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你7连胜的成绩，\n"
"我们将对战点数送给你。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:481
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NoSpaceForPrize"
msgid ""
"You seem to have no space for\n"
"our prize.\p"
"You should return when you have\n"
"organized your BAG.$"
msgstr ""
"你好像没有地方\n"
"放我们的奖品了。\p"
"请整理好背包\n"
"再回来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WeHaveBeenWaiting"
msgid "We have been waiting for you…$"
msgstr "我们一直在等你……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:490
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_MustSaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"I must save before I show you to\n"
"the BATTLE HALL. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战大厅之前，\n"
"我必须先记录。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:494
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_FailedToSaveBeforeEndingChallenge"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You failed to save before you ended\n"
"your challenge the last time.\p"
"As a result, your challenge has been\n"
"disqualified. It is most unfortunate.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"你上次结束挑战之前\n"
"没有记录。\p"
"因此，你的挑战\n"
"被取消了资格。真是太遗憾了。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:502
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_LadyCanTellWhatMonsThink"
msgid ""
"For a hardy fellow like me,\n"
"hardy POKéMON are the best.\p"
"Offense is the best defense!\n"
"A relentless attack is the ultimate!\p"
"But that's not what I wanted to chat\n"
"about.\p"
"Every so often a really cute lady\n"
"swings by here.\p"
"She says that she can tell what\n"
"POKéMON are thinking.\p"
"I don't know about that part,\n"
"but she is really cute.\p"
"Huh?\n"
"Why are you looking at me like that?$"
msgstr ""
"像我这么勤奋的人，\n"
"最适合勤奋性格的宝可梦了。\p"
"进攻就是最好的防守！\n"
"毫不停歇的攻击才是王道！\p"
"不过我想聊的不是这个。\p"
"有一位非常可爱的女士\n"
"偶尔会到这里来。\p"
"她说她能看出\n"
"宝可梦在想什么。\p"
"那个我是不太清楚，\n"
"不过她真的很可爱。\p"
"嗯？\n"
"你干吗那样看着我？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:522
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_NatureAndMovesKeyHere"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\p"
"It appears that the nature of POKéMON\n"
"and the moves that they have been\l"
"taught are the keys to battle here.\p"
"To be more precise, it's how well\n"
"the moves match the nature of\l"
"the POKéMON.\p"
"If your POKéMON is in trouble and\n"
"unable to live up to its potential,\l"
"you may need to examine how well\l"
"its moves match its nature.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\p"
"在这里，宝可梦的性格\n"
"和它学会的招式\l"
"似乎是对战的关键。\p"
"说得更准确一点，\n"
"就是招式和宝可梦的性格\l"
"有多相配。\p"
"如果你的宝可梦陷入困境，\n"
"无法发挥出应有的实力，\l"
"也许需要检查一下\l"
"它的招式和性格是否相配。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:535
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_MonDocileButTransforms"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON is usually very docile.\p"
"But when it's in a BATTLE HALL,\n"
"it sometimes seems to become\l"
"transformed into something wicked!\p"
"It becomes totally intimidating.\n"
"It's shocking, even.$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦平时非常温顺。\p"
"可是一到对战大厅，\n"
"它有时就好像\l"
"变成了邪恶的家伙！\p"
"它会变得非常吓人。\n"
"甚至让人大吃一惊。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:543
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WhatNatureFavorsChippingAway"
msgid ""
"I wonder what sort of nature a POKéMON\n"
"would have if it favored enfeebling its\l"
"opponents and chipping away slowly.\p"
"I'd be surprised if it was a LAX nature.\p"
"But, nah, that can't be right.$"
msgstr ""
"如果一只宝可梦喜欢削弱对手，\n"
"一点一点地消耗对手，\l"
"它会是什么样的性格呢？\p"
"如果是乐天性格，我会很吃惊的。\p"
"不过，嗯，那不可能吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:550
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_WelcomeForDoubleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the hearts of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test.\p"
"I welcome you to the BATTLE PALACE.\p"
"I accept challenges to the DOUBLE\n"
"BATTLE HALLS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家之心的地方。\p"
"欢迎来到对战宫殿。\p"
"这里受理双打对战大厅的挑战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:557
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_TakeDoubleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to take\n"
"the DOUBLE BATTLE HALL challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战双打对战大厅吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:561
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainDoubleBattleChallenge"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE PALACE, there are\n"
"several auditoriums for DOUBLE BATTLES\l"
"that are named DOUBLE BATTLE HALLS.\p"
"The DOUBLE BATTLES are conducted in\n"
"the usual way, except with one crucial\l"
"rule that must be obeyed.\p"
"TRAINERS are permitted only to switch\n"
"their POKéMON in and out.\p"
"TRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\n"
"command their POKéMON.\p"
"The POKéMON are to behave according\n"
"to their nature and battle on their own.\p"
"You must put your trust in your\n"
"POKéMON and watch over them.\p"
"If you achieve the honor of beating\n"
"seven TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战宫殿里有好几个\n"
"进行双打对战的会场，\l"
"名为双打对战大厅。\p"
"双打对战会按照平常的方式进行，\n"
"但有一条必须遵守的重要规则。\p"
"训练家只能\n"
"交换宝可梦。\p"
"除此之外，训练家\n"
"不得向宝可梦下达指令。\p"
"宝可梦会按照自己的性格\n"
"自行战斗。\p"
"你必须信任你的宝可梦，\n"
"在一旁守护它们。\p"
"如果能光荣地连续打败\n"
"7位训练家，\l"
"我们会送你对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:584
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ToDefeatMavenAnd7Trainers"
msgid ""
"To defeat the PALACE MAVEN\n"
"and seven TRAINERS in a row…$"
msgstr ""
"打败了宫殿守护者，\n"
"还连续打败了7位训练家……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:588
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_PresentYouWithBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"In honor of the bond you share with\n"
"your POKéMON, we present you with\l"
"these Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你和宝可梦之间的羁绊，\n"
"我们将这些对战点数送给你。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:593
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_LikeToRecordMatch"
msgid ""
"Would you like to record your latest\n"
"BATTLE PALACE match on your\l"
"FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""
"要把你最近一场对战宫殿的对战\n"
"录到开拓通行证里吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:598
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The BATTLE HALL rules are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着对战大厅的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:601
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:604
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainRulesBasics"
msgid ""
"Here, POKéMON are required to think\n"
"and battle by themselves.\p"
"Unlike in the wild, POKéMON that live\n"
"with people behave differently\l"
"depending on their nature.$"
msgstr ""
"在这里，宝可梦必须\n"
"自己思考、自己战斗。\p"
"和野生的时候不同，\n"
"和人一起生活的宝可梦\l"
"会根据性格做出不同的行动。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:611
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainRulesNature"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"may prefer to attack no matter what.\p"
"Another POKéMON may prefer to protect\n"
"itself from any harm.\p"
"Yet another may enjoy vexing or\n"
"confounding its foes.\p"
"Due to its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"will have favorite moves that it is good\l"
"at using.\p"
"It may also dislike certain moves that\n"
"it has trouble using.$"
msgstr ""
"根据性格的不同，有的宝可梦\n"
"无论如何都喜欢进攻。\p"
"有的宝可梦则喜欢\n"
"保护自己免受伤害。\p"
"还有的喜欢\n"
"捉弄、扰乱对手。\p"
"因为性格的关系，\n"
"宝可梦会有自己喜欢\l"
"又擅长使用的招式。\p"
"也会有一些不喜欢、\n"
"不擅长使用的招式。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:624
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainRulesMoves"
msgid ""
"There are offensive moves that inflict\n"
"direct damage on the foe.\p"
"There are defensive moves that are\n"
"used to prepare for enemy attacks or\l"
"used to heal HP and so on.\p"
"There are also other somewhat-odd\n"
"moves that may enfeeble the foes with\l"
"stat problems including poison and \l"
"paralysis.\p"
"POKéMON will consider using moves in\n"
"these three categories.$"
msgstr ""
"有直接对对手造成伤害的\n"
"攻击招式。\p"
"有用来防备对手攻击、\n"
"回复HP等的防御招式。\p"
"还有一些比较特别的招式，\n"
"可以让对手陷入中毒、麻痹等\l"
"异常状态来削弱对手。\p"
"宝可梦会从这三类招式中\n"
"考虑要使用哪一种。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:637
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainRulesUnderpowered"
msgid ""
"When not under command by its TRAINER,\n"
"a POKéMON may be unable to effectively\l"
"use certain moves.\p"
"A POKéMON is not good at using any\n"
"move that it dislikes.\p"
"If a POKéMON only knows moves that\n"
"do not match its nature, it will often\l"
"be unable to live up to its potential.$"
msgstr ""
"没有训练家的指挥时，\n"
"宝可梦可能无法有效地\l"
"使用某些招式。\p"
"宝可梦不擅长使用\n"
"自己不喜欢的招式。\p"
"如果宝可梦只会和自己性格\n"
"不相配的招式，\l"
"往往就无法发挥出应有的实力。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby/scripts.inc:647
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceLobby_Text_ExplainRulesWhenInDanger"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON may\n"
"start using moves that don't match its\l"
"nature when it is in trouble.\p"
"If a POKéMON begins behaving oddly\n"
"in a pinch, watch it carefully.$"
msgstr ""
"根据性格的不同，有的宝可梦\n"
"陷入困境时会开始使用\l"
"和性格不相配的招式。\p"
"如果宝可梦在危急时刻\n"
"行为变得奇怪，请仔细观察它。$"
